{
  "id": 375854006,
  "iid": 19525,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "snort: Prevent format truncation warning",
  "description": "Instead of having the snort dissector do its own calculation for\nadding the fractional part of the absolute time stamp seconds,\ncall format_fractional_part_nsecs. That function handles format\ntruncation, and so prevents the gcc warning.\n\nThat function includes the decimal point, so adjust for that by\nincreasing the buffer size by 1 and changing where the buffer is\nadded.\n\nThis is currently the last format truncation warning.\nPing #20175",
  "state": "merged",
